silent: (timely=1)
preface only: SETTINGS (timely=1)
idle after a request: SETTINGS ACK HEADERS DATA[hi] GOAWAY(last=1,0) (timely=1)
pings while idle: SETTINGS ACK GOAWAY(last=0,0) (timely=1)
unfinished header block: SETTINGS ACK (timely=1)
no window for the response: SETTINGS ACK ACK HEADERS (timely=1)
